{
  "note": "Market accessories. Each accessory is drawn once per avatar and pose (folder <item>/<avatar>_<pose>/), as square transparent PNG layers on that pose's 1000px canvas. The app pairs the chosen item with the avatar and pose being drawn (JJ-059-C). If an item has no art for that avatar and pose it is hidden there, never drawn wrong. released:false = wired in but NOT wearable yet; flip to true when the item goes on sale in the Market. Item names chosen by Erika 2026-11-11 and renamed 2026-11-12 (JJ-059-C, JJ-060-C). The Dapper Presto set (top hat, monocle, tuxedo, sneakers) is drawn for Señor Jalapresto's standing pose and his nine finished instrument poses; Keywi and Ms. Straw-ccato art for it is pending. display.png in each item folder is the single shelf image used in the Market and dressing room (from Erika's accessories PDF, 2026-11-11). Keywi's set (Ballad Bucket Hat, Fermata Frames, Tenuto Tee, Jazzy Joggers, Serenade Sandals; named by Erika 2026-11-13) is fitted to Keywi's standing pose only; when_worn / unless_worn on a piece pick the version that goes with another worn item. Keywi's set (Ballad Bucket Hat, Fermata Frames, Tenuto Tee, Jazzy Joggers, Serenade Sandals; named by Erika 2026-11-13) is fitted to Keywi's standing pose only; when_worn / unless_worn on a piece pick the version that goes with another worn item. Keywi's set (Ballad Bucket Hat, Fermata Frames, Tenuto Tee, Jazzy Joggers, Serenade Sandals; named by Erika 2026-11-13) is fitted to Keywi's standing pose only; when_worn / unless_worn on a piece pick the version that goes with another worn item. Keywi's set (Ballad Bucket Hat, Fermata Frames, Tenuto Tee, Jazzy Joggers, Serenade Sandals; named by Erika 2026-11-13) is fitted to Keywi's standing pose only; when_worn / unless_worn on a piece pick the version that goes with another worn item. Keywi's set (Ballad Bucket Hat, Fermata Frames, Tenuto Tee, Jazzy Joggers, Serenade Sandals; named by Erika 2026-11-13) is fitted to Keywi's standing pose only; when_worn / unless_worn on a piece pick the version that goes with another worn item. kind: 'dress' is a whole outfit and is never worn with a 'top' or a 'bottom' (Erika, 2026-11-13); putting one on takes the other off, on every avatar.",
